msgid "ACCRINTM(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 0.1; 100) returns 5.0278"
msgstr "ACCRINTM(issue; settlement; rate; par; basis)"

#: xml_doc.cc:552 xml_doc.cc:560
msgid "Redemption"
msgstr "Redemption"

#: xml_doc.cc:554
msgid ""
"The INTRATE function returns the interest rate for a fully invested "
"security. Basis is the type of day counting you want to use: 0: US 30/360 "
"(default), 1: real days, 2: real days/360, 3: real days/365 or 4: European "
"30/365."
msgstr ""
"The INTRATE ຟັງຊັ້ນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າອັດຕາເຕັມ "
"ພື້ນຖານແມ່ນພິມມື້ເພື່ອນັບຕາມທີ່່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ: 0: US 30/360 "
"(default), 1: ມື້ແທ້, 2: ມື້ແທ້/360, 3: ມື້ແທ້/365 or 4: ຢູໂລບ"
"30/365. "

